{"id":"wb-5-410","name":"科迦寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"科迦寺","text":"科迦寺，藏语称“科迦贡巴”（藏语：འཁོར་ཞགས་དགོན་པ，威利转写：’khor zhags dgon pa），位于西藏自治区阿里地区普兰县普兰镇科迦村，是一座藏传佛教萨迦派寺院。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%A7%91%E8%BF%A6%E5%AF%BA","revisionId":95046493,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95046493","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":null}